OL,3,GNEWSAClub where footballer Cody Fisher
OL,4,Amurdered re-opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nightclub where footballer Cody
OL,7,FFisher was murdered nearly four years
OL,8,Fago will re-open later under a new
OL,9,Fname.
OL,11,FFisher, 23, was killed on the dance
OL,12,Ffloor of the Crane club in Digbeth,
OL,13,FBirmingham, on Boxing Day in 2022. Remy
OL,14,FGordon and Kami Carpenter were later
OL,15,Fjailed for his murder, after the club's
OL,16,Flicence was revoked in January 2023
OL,17,Fover safety fears.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
