OL,3,GNEWSAClub where footballer Cody Fisher
OL,4,Amurdered re-opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn March, a judge recommended the
OL,7,Flicence be restored after venue bosses
OL,8,Fmet the city council, which also
OL,9,Fconsulted police, to draw up the
OL,10,Flicence, which is subject to stringent
OL,11,Frisk assessment and safety conditions.
OL,13,FRe-named GASWRX, DJ Armand Van Helden
OL,14,Fheadlines the launch event, with street
OL,15,Ffood vendors and other performers in
OL,16,Fattendance.
